Third-party notices for the PL F12 module. Debian package copyright texts are installed in /usr/share/doc and /usr/share/common-licenses.

pycdlib 1.22.0 by Chris Lalancette and contributors is distributed under LGPL-2.1-only.
The unmodified library is installed in /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/pycdlib.
Its license is included in /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/pycdlib-1.22.0.dist-info/licenses/COPYING.
The corresponding source distribution is python/pycdlib-1.22.0.tar.gz in f12-source-lock.json.

Strelec recovery media support uses the unmodified Debian hivex library and Python binding.
Their notices are in /usr/share/doc/libhivex0/copyright and /usr/share/doc/python3-hivex/copyright.
The PL Windows guest executables use the MinGW-w64 CRT and GCC runtime.
The original mingw-w64.COPYRIGHT and gcc-mingw-w64.COPYRIGHT texts, including the GCC Runtime Library Exception,
are in /usr/share/pl/provenance/f12. Source versions and checksums are in f12-source-lock.json.

The Strelec PC BIOS loader is built from iPXE wimboot 2.9.0, with the PL SSTR directory alias for its BCD.
The original source archive f12-wimboot-e587564.tar.gz, f12-wimboot-sstr.patch and toolchain metadata in
f12.sources.json are in /usr/share/pl/provenance/f12. The build commands are in deploy/images/f12.Dockerfile
in source.tar.gz. See wimboot-LICENSE.txt below for the GPL terms.

